# DeZ4p Android Manager

**Professional Android Device Management for Windows**

**مدیریت حرفه ای دستگاه های اندروید برای ویندوز**

![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.0-blue) ![Platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/platform-Windows%2010%2B-0078D6) ![Android](https://img.shields.io/badge/Android-7.0%20--%2016-3DDC84) ![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green)

---

## Features

- Windows 10 (build 1909+) / Windows 11 / Server 2019-2022
- Android 7.0 (API 24) to Android 16 (API 36)
- ADB 1.0.36 to 1.0.41+
- All OEMs: Pixel, Samsung, Xiaomi, OnePlus, Oppo, Realme, Vivo, Huawei, Asus, Sony, Motorola, Nokia

## Integrated Tools

**Device Management:** Dashboard, Device Info, File Manager, Media Gallery, Contacts and SMS

**App Management:** Apps Manager, APK Installer, App Backup, Split APK Tools

**Advanced Tools:** Screen Mirror (scrcpy), Screenshot and Record, Wireless ADB, Backup and Restore, Recovery Manager, ADB Console, Fastboot Console, Logcat Viewer, Process Manager, Sensors Panel, Storage Analyzer, Battery Lab, Network Tools, Security Center, Permissions Manager, Privacy Tools, Script Runner, Task Scheduler

**Flash Tools:** Flash Tools, Bootloader Tools, Partition Tools

---

## Installation

### Option 1: Installer (Recommended)

1. Download DeZ4p-Android-Manager-Setup-v1.0.0.exe
2. Run the installer
3. Follow the wizard (runtime auto-installed if needed)
4. Launch from Start Menu or Desktop

### Option 2: Portable

1. Download DeZ4p-Android-Manager-v1.0.0-portable.zip
2. Extract anywhere
3. Run DeZ4pAndroidManager.exe

> Portable requires .NET 8 Desktop Runtime: https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/8.0

---

## Requirements

- Windows 10 (build 1909+) or Windows 11
- .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (auto-installed by Setup)
- ADB (bundled)
- Android device with USB Debugging enabled

---

## Build from Source

Prerequisites: .NET 8 SDK, Git

    git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/dez4p-android-manager.git
    cd dez4p-android-manager
    dotnet restore
    dotnet build -c Release
    dotnet run --project src\DeZ4pAndroidManager

